{"id":"n99acfa63af","headline":"ECB holds rates at 2.5% as President Lagarde announces early departure","summary":"The European Central Bank kept its benchmark interest rate at 2.5%, citing concerns that borrowing costs could hinder growth. ECB President Christine Lagarde announced she will resign on February 7, 2027, nine months before her term ends.","why":"The ECB sets monetary policy for the Eurozone. Leadership changes and interest rate decisions are critical for European bond and equity markets.","category":"economy","importance":3,"flag":null,"market_moving":true,"location":{"place":"Frankfurt","country":"Germany","lat":50.111,"lon":8.682,"region":"eu"},"entities":[{"name":"European Central Bank","ticker":null}],"links":[],"source":{"name":"Daily Sabah","url":"https://www.dailysabah.com/business/economy/ecb-holds-key-rate-steady-at-25-amid-lagardes-early-exit"},"sources":[{"name":"Daily Sabah","url":"https://www.dailysabah.com/business/economy/ecb-holds-key-rate-steady-at-25-amid-lagardes-early-exit"},{"name":"Daily Sabah","url":"https://www.dailysabah.com/business/economy/christine-lagarde-french-steering-ecb-through-covid-19-energy-shocks"},{"name":"Money Times","url":"https://www.moneytimes.com.br/bce-mantem-juros-em-25-com-crise-na-franca-e-riscos-inflacionarios-no-radar/"},{"name":"Clarín","url":"https://www.clarin.com/mundo/christine-lagarde-renuncia-presidenta-banco-central-europeo-9-meses-finalizar-mandato_0_2kaTfZkrFx.html"}],"published_at":"2026-10-29T12:06:00Z","retrieved_at":"2026-10-29T14:54:01Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"score":63.2,"content_hash":"7acf7e371f86bda3","impacts":[],"why_moved":"The decision to hold rates was expected, but the surprise resignation of the ECB President introduces political and policy uncertainty.","image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/bank-building-371288.jpg","alt":"bank building (illustration)","credit":"hslergr1","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summ